# The Z9X HB manifest: the core manifest (apps/LumenProjector/core/AndroidManifest.xml) with the HB changes of
# the design notes (D5, 7.2, 10.2), the patch line of the HB recipe (assemble_app.py rule 10):
# sharedUserId android.uid.system (the stock vendor policy grants binder call on aidl_gmpf_xgimi to system_app only),
# a direct boot aware application whose components but BootReceiver are not, the HB home tile receiver and the device
# state provider, no 3D key action, no statistics switch or mirroring tile grant (the system uid needs none). A core
# change under a patched line is red: review it, then make the diff again (diff -u --label a/AndroidManifest.xml
# --label b/AndroidManifest.xml apps/LumenProjector/core/AndroidManifest.xml NEW).
--- a/AndroidManifest.xml
