 <?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
 <!--
-  org.lumen.projector ("Projector") of Lumen OS 1.0 for XGIMI projectors (author kmuradoff; package and
-  property names keep the internal z9x prefix in v1).
-  Install: /system/app/Z9xProjector/Z9xProjector.apk (NOT priv-app), platform-signed, no sharedUserId.
+  org.lumen.projector ("Projector") of Lumen OS for the XGIMI Z9X HB (goat_elegant): the Z9X manifest
+  (apps/LumenProjector/core) with the HB changes of devices/goat_elegant/PROJECTOR_DESIGN.md (D5, 7.2, 10.2):
+  - android:sharedUserId="android.uid.system" (SELinux domain system_app): the stock vendor policy grants
+    binder call on aidl_gmpf_xgimi to system_app only (research/handshake.md 7). Install:
+    /system/priv-app/HbProjector/HbProjector.apk with its privapp permissions file (compose_hb.sh), signed with
+    the goat_elegant platform key;
+  - the application is direct boot aware (the vendor handshake runs before unlock, as HbBoot did); every
+    component says directBootAware="false" except BootReceiver (LOCKED_BOOT_COMPLETED and BOOT_COMPLETED);
+  - no problem reports (Z9X only);
+  - the OTA state receiver power.OtaStateReceiver (docs/architecture/OTA_CLIENT.md step S5) is back for the
+    updater LumenUpdater, guarded by the signature permission OTA_STATE as on the Z9X; not direct boot aware
+    (the updater runs only after unlock).
+  Z9X notes kept below.
   versionCode/versionName come from build_apk.sh (Lumen OS 1.0: VERSION_CODE=100 VERSION_NAME=1.0;
   Lumen OS 1.0.0: VERSION_CODE=101 VERSION_NAME=1.0.0; Lumen OS 1.0.1: VERSION_CODE=102 VERSION_NAME=1.0.1;
   Lumen OS 1.0.2: VERSION_CODE=103 VERSION_NAME=1.0.2; Lumen OS 1.0.3: VERSION_CODE=104 VERSION_NAME=1.0.3).
